1
00:00:02,23 --> 00:00:04,72
Phoebe found out about this lady...
我們跑去海邊 因為菲比找到一個女人

2
00:00:04,93 --> 00:00:09,03
...who knew her parents, and I don't know what happened.
她認識她的父母 然後我就不知道了

3
00:00:09,30 --> 00:00:10,90
I'm your mother.
我是你的母親

4
00:00:11,64 --> 00:00:14,77
Monica joked she wouldn't date Chandler.
摩妮卡開玩笑說 她不會跟錢德這種人約會

5
00:00:14,98 --> 00:00:17,88
I don't know what happened there either.
他一直很在意 然後我也不知道了

6
00:00:18,08 --> 00:00:20,31
Ross' new girlfriend shows up.
羅斯的新女朋友邦妮跑來

7
00:00:20,55 --> 00:00:24,45
Rachel gets Bonnie to shave her head. Then they kiss.
瑞秋說服她理了個大光頭 然後羅斯和瑞秋接吻了

8
00:00:24,65 --> 00:00:27,82
Now he has to choose Rachel or the bald girl.
現在他得在瑞秋 和光頭女之間二選一

9
00:00:28,16 --> 00:00:30,25
I don't know what happened there either.
然後我還是不知道

10
00:00:30,46 --> 00:00:32,93
Hold on. Let me go get Chandler.
等一下，我去找錢德來

11
00:00:49,98 --> 00:00:52,61
She's helping me. My head's sunburned.
她在幫我搽藥，我的頭曬傷了

12
00:00:55,52 --> 00:00:58,82
-Thanks a million. -You're welcome a million.
感激不盡 不用客氣

13
00:00:59,02 --> 00:01:00,99
Smell it.
你聞

14
00:01:03,59 --> 00:01:05,62
Minty.
涼涼的

15
00:01:06,96 --> 00:01:09,05
I'll be in our room.
我先回房去

16
00:01:23,48 --> 00:01:24,67
Oh,my God!
天哪

17
00:01:24,88 --> 00:01:26,37
I know.
我知道

18
00:01:30,15 --> 00:01:31,52
I got to go.
好，我走了

19
00:01:32,25 --> 00:01:33,28
Why?
什麼？為什麼？

20
00:01:33,42 --> 00:01:36,05
I got to go break up with Bonnie.
我得跟邦妮分手

21
00:01:36,66 --> 00:01:38,22
Here? Now?
在這裡？現在？

22
00:01:38,46 --> 00:01:40,29
I can't stay here all night.
我不能整晚留在這裡

23
00:01:40,56 --> 00:01:43,40
If I go in there,she'll want to...
要是我回房，她會想…

24
00:01:44,10 --> 00:01:45,09
...do stuff.
嘿咻

25
00:01:46,30 --> 00:01:49,00
Can't you say you aren't in the mood?
你不能說你沒心情嗎？

26
00:01:49,17 --> 00:01:50,66
No,she likes that.
她喜歡那樣

27
00:01:52,64 --> 00:01:54,37
Faking sleep doesn't work.
裝睡也沒用

28
00:01:54,64 --> 00:01:57,20
I've woken up many times with her
我經常早上醒來發現她在…

29
00:01:57,35 --> 00:01:58,33
好

30
00:02:00,08 --> 00:02:03,05
-Why am I telling you? -I don't know.
我說這個幹什麼？ 我不知道

31
00:02:12,26 --> 00:02:15,29
-Not every morning -Making it worse!
並不是每天早上都… 再描會更黑

32
00:02:16,76 --> 00:02:18,66
The One with the Jellyfish
本集播出：「前緣難續」

00:02:21,66 --> 00:02:23,66
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

33
00:03:04,41 --> 00:03:07,38
You probably want to know how it happened.
你大概想知道前因後果

34
00:03:07,65 --> 00:03:10,08
I think I can figure it out.
我猜想得到

35
00:03:10,35 --> 00:03:14,15
I was born,and then everyone lied their asses off.
我出生之後 大家開始卯起來撒謊

36
00:03:14,89 --> 00:03:17,36
No,it wasn't like that.
不是那樣的

37
00:03:17,69 --> 00:03:21,18
Remember how I said Lilly,Frank and I were close?
我不是說過 莉莉、法蘭克和我很要好？

38
00:03:22,46 --> 00:03:24,02
We were very close.
我們非常要好

39
00:03:24,30 --> 00:03:25,66
How close?
怎麼說？

40
00:03:25,87 --> 00:03:29,46
The three of us were kind of a couple.
我們三個是一對

41
00:03:31,31 --> 00:03:33,74
I don't know how that would work.
三個怎麼會是一對

42
00:03:33,94 --> 00:03:35,03
I'm not asking!
我們… 我不是在問你

43
00:03:36,41 --> 00:03:38,94
Anyhow,somehow I got pregnant...
總之，我不知怎的懷孕了

44
00:03:39,65 --> 00:03:41,14
...and I was...
我很…

45
00:03:41,62 --> 00:03:45,11
...scared. I was stupid and selfish....
…害怕，我愚昧又自私…

46
00:03:45,99 --> 00:03:50,45
I was 18 years old. Remember what it was like to be 18?
我才18歲 還記得你的18歲嗎？

47
00:03:50,66 --> 00:03:53,49
Mom killed herself and my dad ran off.
記得，媽自殺，爸跑掉

48
00:03:53,73 --> 00:03:57,66
I lived in a Gremlin with a guy who talked to his hand.
我跟一個叫山迪的人住在一起 他會跟他的手說話

49
00:03:59,90 --> 00:04:04,34
I'm sorry. I thought I'd left you with the best parents.
對不起 我以為他們是世上最好的父母

50
00:04:04,51 --> 00:04:07,37
I didn't hear about them till a few years ago.
直到幾年前 我才聽說他們的事

51
00:04:07,64 --> 00:04:09,80
By then,you were already grown-up.
當時你已經長大了

52
00:04:09,98 --> 00:04:14,57
You're here and I would really like to get to know you.
既然你來了，我也想多認識你

53
00:04:14,75 --> 00:04:16,65
Well,everybody does.
每個人都想認識我

54
00:04:17,92 --> 00:04:19,94
I'm a really cool person.
我是個很酷的人

55
00:04:20,26 --> 00:04:24,12
You had 29 years to find out, but you didn't even try.
你有29年的時間可以查 卻連試都沒試

56
00:04:25,43 --> 00:04:28,52
You walked out on me, and I'll do the same.
你扔下我不管，現在我也要

57
00:04:29,53 --> 00:04:32,02
I don't ever want to see you again.
等一下

58
00:04:29,76 --> 00:04:31,53
我不想再見到你

59
00:04:36,00 --> 00:04:37,94
Where's my purse?
我的皮包呢？

60
00:04:39,84 --> 00:04:41,83
Shoot! We're out of soda.
討厭，沒有汽水了

61
00:04:42,11 --> 00:04:44,44
-I'll get you some. -Really?
我去幫你買 真的？

62
00:04:44,61 --> 00:04:47,01
No,because I'm not your boyfriend.
才怪，我又不是你的男朋友

63
00:04:49,05 --> 00:04:50,95
Hey,Pheebs,how'd it go?
菲比，怎麼樣？

65
00:04:53,49 --> 00:04:56,92
My mom's friend,Phoebe, is actually my birth mom.
我媽的朋友菲比 其實是我的親生母親

66
00:05:00,33 --> 00:05:02,66
I found a dried-up seahorse.
我檢到一個幹掉的海馬

67
00:05:03,67 --> 00:05:05,10
What do you mean?
什麼意思？

68
00:05:05,30 --> 00:05:08,27
My new mom, who's a big fat abandoner.
我的新媽媽當年拋棄了我

69
00:05:09,80 --> 00:05:13,24
Don't you want to stay here and talk about it?
菲比，等等 你不坐下來聊一聊嗎？

71
00:05:15,21 --> 00:05:16,97
I need to be alone.
不了，我想靜一靜

72
00:05:20,11 --> 00:05:21,38
摩妮卡

73
00:05:27,06 --> 00:05:29,05
Man. Hey...

74
00:05:29,19 --> 00:05:32,52
...what if you found out that your mom wasn't really your mom...
要是你發現你媽不是你媽

75
00:05:32,66 --> 00:05:36,36
...and your new mom turned out to be really hot?
而你的新媽媽又很辣呢？

76
00:05:36,50 --> 00:05:39,40
Oh,man,huh?

77
00:05:40,54 --> 00:05:43,27
But,it's your mom.
但她是你媽耶

78
00:05:43,40 --> 00:05:46,93
No,I'm talking about your mom.
不，我是在說你媽

79
00:05:55,82 --> 00:05:56,84
It's over.
結束了

80
00:05:58,42 --> 00:06:00,08
Was it awful?
很慘嗎？

81
00:06:00,25 --> 00:06:01,74
It was long.
很久

82
00:06:02,52 --> 00:06:04,62
I didn't realize how late it was...
我沒意識到那麼晚了

83
00:06:04,83 --> 00:06:07,85
...till I saw the five o'clock shadow on her head.
直到她頭上出現5點鐘的日影

84
00:06:13,27 --> 00:06:17,33
She didn't want to stay. I called a cab. She just left.
她不想留下來 我幫她叫了車，她剛走

85
00:06:25,01 --> 00:06:27,00
I wrote you a letter.
我寫了封信給你

86
00:06:27,28 --> 00:06:29,11
Oh,thank you!
謝謝

87
00:06:30,22 --> 00:06:32,02
I like mail.
我喜歡收信

88
00:06:36,29 --> 00:06:40,42
It's just some things I've been thinking about. About us.
我想了一些關於我們的事

89
00:06:40,66 --> 00:06:44,10
Before we even think about us getting back together...
在我們考慮復合之前

90
00:06:44,33 --> 00:06:47,39
...I need to know how you feel about this stuff.
我得知道你對這封信的想法

91
00:06:50,20 --> 00:06:51,50
好

92
00:06:57,88 --> 00:07:00,01
It's 5:30 in the morning.
現在是早上5點半

93
00:07:02,88 --> 00:07:06,34
So I'd better get cracking on this baby.
我最好趕快看完

94
00:07:09,19 --> 00:07:11,45
I'll be waiting for you. Come up when you're done.
我等你，看完就上來

95
00:07:12,56 --> 00:07:14,53
I'll be up...
好，我要花…

96
00:07:15,36 --> 00:07:16,83
...in 18 pages.
十八頁的時間

97
00:07:19,00 --> 00:07:20,30
Front and back.
從頭到尾

98
00:07:22,17 --> 00:07:24,00
Very exciting!
好興奮喔

99
00:07:50,03 --> 00:07:52,50
What happened to you? Why didn't you come up?
怎麼了？你怎麼沒上來？

100
00:07:53,20 --> 00:07:54,33
Done.
看完了

101
00:07:56,14 --> 00:07:59,37
-You just finished? -I wanted to be thorough.
你才剛看完？ 我想看仔細一點

102
00:08:00,07 --> 00:08:05,24
This is clearly very important to you. To us.
這對你…對我們顯然很重要

103
00:08:05,41 --> 00:08:09,18
I wanted to read every word carefully.
我想一字一句用心斟酌

104
00:08:09,38 --> 00:08:11,65
Twice.
斟酌兩次

106
00:08:14,99 --> 00:08:16,92
Does it?
所以…行嗎？

107
00:08:22,36 --> 00:08:24,30
I'm sorry?
什麼？

108
00:08:25,53 --> 00:08:27,13
Does it?
行嗎？

109
00:08:28,27 --> 00:08:32,33
Does it? Does it?
行嗎？行嗎？

110
00:08:35,14 --> 00:08:39,81
I wanted to give that whole "Does it?" part another glance.
我想再瞄一眼「行嗎」的部份

111
00:08:39,98 --> 00:08:43,08
What do you mean? You said you read it twice.
什麼意思？你說你看了兩次

112
00:08:43,35 --> 00:08:46,95
It either does or doesn't. If you have to think
行不行一句話 如果你還要考慮…

113
00:08:47,19 --> 00:08:50,45
No,I don't have to think about it.
不，我不用考慮，不用

114
00:08:50,66 --> 00:08:51,92
In fact...
事實上…

115
00:08:52,69 --> 00:08:55,42
...I've decided. I have decided...
我已經決定了，我決定…

116
00:08:55,93 --> 00:08:57,59
...that it...
這件事…

117
00:09:03,10 --> 00:09:04,47
...does.
行

118
00:09:21,29 --> 00:09:24,19
-Are you sure? -Sure,I'm sure!
你確定？ 確定

119
00:09:31,47 --> 00:09:35,63
There's a nuclear holocaust. I'm the last man on earth.
好，發生核爆災難 我是世上僅存的男人

120
00:09:36,00 --> 00:09:38,20
Would you go out with me?
你會跟我約會嗎？

121
00:09:43,51 --> 00:09:45,95
I've got canned goods.
我有罐頭喔

122
00:09:46,98 --> 00:09:49,07
Take a look at this!
喂，你們看

123
00:09:49,32 --> 00:09:52,45
Check this baby out! Dug me a hole.
你們瞧瞧，我挖了個洞

124
00:09:54,52 --> 00:09:56,58
Excellent hole,Joe.
好棒的洞啊

125
00:09:58,29 --> 00:10:00,59
Oh,no! My hole!
不！我的洞！

126
00:10:00,76 --> 00:10:02,25
My foot!
我的腳！

127
00:10:03,30 --> 00:10:04,42
What is it?
怎麼了？

128
00:10:04,80 --> 00:10:07,93
Jellyfish sting! It hurts!
我被水母咬了，好痛…

129
00:10:08,20 --> 00:10:10,19
Can we help you to the house?
要不要扶你回去？

130
00:10:10,40 --> 00:10:11,74
It's two miles.
2哩耶

131
00:10:11,94 --> 00:10:14,20
And I'm tired from digging.
而且我挖洞挖得好累

132
00:10:15,78 --> 00:10:17,54
Damn the jellyfish!
該死的水母

133
00:10:17,78 --> 00:10:20,25
Damn all the jellyfish!
所有的水母都去死

134
00:10:20,45 --> 00:10:21,75
Do something.
得想個辦法

135
00:10:21,98 --> 00:10:23,45
There's only one thing.
只有一個辦法

136
00:10:23,65 --> 00:10:24,74
What is it?
什麼辦法？

137
00:10:24,99 --> 00:10:26,25
Pee on it.
在傷口上撒尿

138
00:10:29,09 --> 00:10:30,08
Gross!
什麼？好惡！

139
00:10:30,32 --> 00:10:32,49
I saw it on Discovery Channel.
別怪我 我是在探索頻道上看到的

140
00:10:32,79 --> 00:10:36,13
He's right. There's ammonia in that...
他沒唬你，尿液裡有氨

141
00:10:36,80 --> 00:10:38,16
...that kills the pain.
可以止痛

142
00:10:38,43 --> 00:10:42,30
Forget it. It doesn't hurt that bad!
我不要，其實沒那麼痛…

143
00:10:43,50 --> 00:10:45,40
You can use my hole for privacy.
你可以躲進我的洞裡

144
00:10:48,98 --> 00:10:52,14
I'm ready to get the hell out of here.
我準備好要走了

145
00:10:54,62 --> 00:10:55,78
Are you?
你們…？真的？

146
00:10:57,52 --> 00:10:59,42
That's so great!
太棒了

147
00:10:59,75 --> 00:11:00,91
Not for Bonnie.
邦妮好可憐

148
00:11:02,89 --> 00:11:04,45
But for you,yea!
但恭喜你們了

149
00:11:06,49 --> 00:11:09,83
-How was the beach? -Nothing. I don't know.
海邊好玩嗎？ 不怎麼樣，我不知道

150
00:11:12,53 --> 00:11:14,50
-What happened? -Nothing.
怎麼了？ 沒事

151
00:11:14,70 --> 00:11:17,17
-I'm going to shower. -Me too.
我要去沖澡 我也是

152
00:11:17,44 --> 00:11:18,63
Me too.
我也是

153
00:11:19,94 --> 00:11:21,60
I'll put this in the car.
我把袋子拿到車上

154
00:11:21,84 --> 00:11:24,00
I have to go pack!
我得去收東西

155
00:11:25,38 --> 00:11:28,01
-And it really does? -lt does.
真的行嗎？ 行

156
00:11:28,22 --> 00:11:30,31
It really and truly does.
真的真的行

157
00:11:53,01 --> 00:11:55,81
It so does not!
行你個頭！

158
00:11:59,71 --> 00:12:01,68
（中央咖啡館）

159
00:12:01,92 --> 00:12:06,44
She wants me to take responsibility for everything that went wrong.
她要我對我們的失和 負起全部的責任

160
00:12:07,09 --> 00:12:11,92
She goes on for five pages about how I was unfaithful to her.
她寫了整整五頁 說我如何不忠

161
00:12:12,63 --> 00:12:15,22
We were on a break!
我們當時分手了

162
00:12:15,50 --> 00:12:19,66
If you say that one more time, I'll break up with you.
天哪，你再說一次 我就跟你分手

163
00:12:21,07 --> 00:12:24,73
This breakup was not all my fault. She says here...
分手不是我一個人的錯 她寫說

164
00:12:25,04 --> 00:12:27,84
..."lf you accept full responsibility...
「要是你負起全部的責任」

165
00:12:28,04 --> 00:12:30,57
...I can begin to trust you again.
「我就能再次信任你」

166
00:12:30,78 --> 00:12:34,44
Does that seem like something you can do? Does it?"
「你想你辦得到嗎？行嗎？」

167
00:12:37,15 --> 00:12:38,98
不行

168
00:12:39,79 --> 00:12:43,05
You have what you want. You're back with her.
你得償所願，跟她復合了

169
00:12:43,29 --> 00:12:46,23
If you bring this up now, you'll wreck it.
現在提出來 會毀了你一生中最美好的事

170
00:12:46,53 --> 00:12:48,86
Yeah,I know. You're right.
我知道，你說得對

171
00:12:51,13 --> 00:12:52,33
I'll let it go.
我會就此打住

172
00:12:52,63 --> 00:12:55,80
But you know how hard it is to forget this?
但你們瞭解這件事很難忘記吧

173
00:12:56,07 --> 00:12:57,63
Sure,it's hard...
當然很難

174
00:12:57,91 --> 00:13:00,64
...but you don't have to talk about it.
但你不必拿出來談

175
00:13:01,54 --> 00:13:03,94
A lot happened on that trip...
這次度假有很多事 

176
00:13:04,15 --> 00:13:07,31
...that we should never,ever talk about.
都該從此絕口不提

177
00:13:09,92 --> 00:13:12,11
What happened on that beach?
在海邊到底怎麼了？

178
00:13:13,82 --> 00:13:16,81
It's between us and the sea,Ross.
那是我們和大海的秘密

179
00:13:26,40 --> 00:13:27,80
Hi,Ursula.
烏蘇拉

180
00:13:29,24 --> 00:13:32,83
I know that we haven't talked in a long time.
我知道我們很久沒聯絡了

181
00:13:33,14 --> 00:13:37,87
Our mom is not our birth mom. This other lady is our birth mom.
但我們的媽媽不是親媽媽 另一個女的才是

182
00:13:38,11 --> 00:13:41,24
Right,the one that lives in Montauk.
對，住在莫陶克的那個

183
00:13:41,72 --> 00:13:42,70
You know her?
你認識她？

184
00:13:42,98 --> 00:13:46,71
No. I read about her in Mom's suicide note.
不認識，但媽的遺書裡有提到

185
00:13:46,99 --> 00:13:51,22
There was a suicide note? Do you still have it?
媽有留遺書？還在嗎？

186
00:13:52,16 --> 00:13:53,75
Hang on.
等一下

187
00:13:56,10 --> 00:13:59,03
I can't believe you didn't tell me there was a suicide note.
你居然沒告訴我有遺書

188
00:13:59,30 --> 00:14:01,50
Yeah,so how have you been doing?
是啊，你最近好嗎？

189
00:14:02,84 --> 00:14:04,13
Shut up!
我…閉嘴

190
00:14:08,64 --> 00:14:11,34
"Goodbye,Phoebe and Ursula. I'll miss you.
「別了，菲比與烏蘇拉」 「我會想念你們」

191
00:14:11,55 --> 00:14:14,04
P.S. Your mom lives in Montauk."
「又：你們母親住在莫陶克」

192
00:14:15,35 --> 00:14:16,78
You just wrote this!
這是你剛才寫的

193
00:14:18,29 --> 00:14:20,88
It's pretty much the gist.
差不多是這個意思

194
00:14:22,16 --> 00:14:25,28
Except for the poem. You read the poem,right?
只差那首詩，你讀過那首詩吧

195
00:14:25,63 --> 00:14:26,96
沒有

196
00:14:27,60 --> 00:14:29,59
All right. Hang on.
等一下

197
00:14:34,54 --> 00:14:36,56
Pass the cheese,please.
請把起司給我

198
00:14:41,88 --> 00:14:44,81
You can't even look at me,can you?
你連看都不敢看我，對吧？

199
00:14:45,05 --> 00:14:46,31
對

200
00:14:47,75 --> 00:14:50,11
It's Phoebe! We can talk to Phoebe!
是菲比！我們可以跟菲比說話

201
00:14:52,42 --> 00:14:54,18
I'm too depressed to talk.
我很沮喪，不想說話

202
00:14:54,46 --> 00:14:56,62
I'll give you $1000 to talk to us.
我給你1千元開口費

203
00:14:57,76 --> 00:15:01,96
What about making that beach trip an annual thing?
我們要不要每年都回去玩？

204
00:15:02,23 --> 00:15:03,56
不要

205
00:15:04,27 --> 00:15:06,20
What happened out there?
夠了，到底出了什麼事？

206
00:15:06,73 --> 00:15:09,97
What? We took a walk. Nothing happened.
什麼？ 我們只是去散步，沒什麼

207
00:15:10,24 --> 00:15:13,10
I came back with nothing all over me.
我身上什麼都沒沾到

208
00:15:13,57 --> 00:15:15,41
What happened? Joey?
拜託，到底是…喬伊？

209
00:15:17,04 --> 00:15:18,20
All right.
好吧 不行

210
00:15:18,48 --> 00:15:20,38
We swore we'd never tell.
我們發誓要死守秘密

211
00:15:20,61 --> 00:15:22,64
They'll never understand.
他們不會瞭解的

212
00:15:25,89 --> 00:15:29,65
We have to get it out. It's eating me alive!
我們得說出來，我快被逼瘋了

213
00:15:32,66 --> 00:15:35,93
-Monica got stung by a jellyfish. -All right!
摩妮卡被水母咬到 好吧

214
00:15:39,43 --> 00:15:41,09
好吧

215
00:15:43,87 --> 00:15:45,53
I got stung.
我被咬到

216
00:15:46,74 --> 00:15:48,50
Stung bad.
咬得很嚴重

217
00:15:50,54 --> 00:15:52,24
I couldn't stand.
站都站不直

218
00:15:52,71 --> 00:15:54,44
I couldn't walk.
走也走不動

219
00:15:54,68 --> 00:15:57,24
We were two miles from the house.
我們離小屋2哩遠

220
00:15:58,55 --> 00:16:00,61
We were scared and alone.
既孤單又害怕

221
00:16:01,32 --> 00:16:03,81
We didn't think we could make it.
我們還以為死定了

222
00:16:08,30 --> 00:16:09,82
I was in too much pain.
我痛得要命

223
00:16:10,03 --> 00:16:12,16
And I was tired from digging.
我剛挖完洞好累

224
00:16:14,70 --> 00:16:17,33
Then Joey remembered something.
然後喬伊想起一件事

225
00:16:18,44 --> 00:16:20,77
I'd seen it on Discovery Channel.
是在探索頻道上看到的

226
00:16:21,01 --> 00:16:22,64
Wait,I saw that.
慢著，我也看過

227
00:16:22,84 --> 00:16:27,30
On the Discovery Channel. About jellyfish and how if you
是探索頻道沒錯 它說要是你被水母…

229
00:16:31,89 --> 00:16:33,44
You peed on yourself?
你在自己身上撒尿？

230
00:16:35,66 --> 00:16:38,75
You can't say that! You don't know!
你不能這麼說！你不知道

231
00:16:39,26 --> 00:16:41,56
I thought I would pass out.
我都快痛昏了

232
00:16:42,30 --> 00:16:45,42
I tried,but I couldn't...
我試過，但沒辦法…

233
00:16:45,83 --> 00:16:47,10
...bend that way.
彎成那個姿勢

234
00:16:49,94 --> 00:16:51,23
所以…

235
00:16:57,01 --> 00:16:59,81
That's right. I stepped up.
沒錯，我挺身而出

236
00:17:02,32 --> 00:17:05,05
She's my friend and she needed help.
她是我的朋友，她需要幫助

237
00:17:05,59 --> 00:17:07,99
If I had to, I'd pee on any of you.
如果有必要 我也會在你們身上撒尿

238
00:17:13,69 --> 00:17:14,72
Only...
只不過…

239
00:17:14,93 --> 00:17:16,09
...I couldn't.
我尿不出來

240
00:17:19,67 --> 00:17:21,73
I got the stage fright.
我怯場了

241
00:17:23,17 --> 00:17:27,11
I wanted to help, but there was too much pressure.
我很想幫忙，但壓力太大了

243
00:17:27,37 --> 00:17:29,43
So I turned to Chandler.
所以我找錢德

244
00:17:32,71 --> 00:17:37,12
Joey kept screaming at me, "Do it now. Do it. Do it now!"
喬伊一直對我大叫 「快尿！快點尿！」

245
00:17:38,55 --> 00:17:42,28
Sometimes,late at night, I can still hear the screaming.
有時在深夜裡 我還會聽到那個叫聲

246
00:17:44,89 --> 00:17:48,66
Because I do it through my wall to freak you out.
那是我在隔壁嚇你

247
00:17:49,23 --> 00:17:51,32
Maybe there's somebody you guys could talk to.
也許你們可以找人談談

248
00:17:51,47 --> 00:17:53,09
Oh,who?
找誰？ 

249
00:17:53,23 --> 00:17:56,36
It's not like they have a group for people like us.
難道這種事還有團體治療？

250
00:17:57,20 --> 00:18:00,80
Yeah,no,there's this guy Owen,he's the best.
有個叫歐文的很厲害

251
00:18:00,97 --> 00:18:03,34
Might have his card.
我有他的名片

252
00:18:04,85 --> 00:18:08,51
And fuchsia and mauve
還有紫紅色和淡紫色

253
00:18:09,18 --> 00:18:13,55
Those are the 66 colors of my bedroom
這就是我房裡的六十六種顏色

254
00:18:16,12 --> 00:18:20,69
I invite all of you to count the colors in your bedroom.
大家都回去算算房裡的顏色吧

256
00:18:21,63 --> 00:18:23,99
Except for you. You go away.
你除外，你給我滾

257
00:18:28,04 --> 00:18:30,03
I'll go in a second.
我馬上就走

258
00:18:30,30 --> 00:18:32,20
I just want to tell you...
我只想告訴你

259
00:18:32,47 --> 00:18:36,31
...there wasn't a day I didn't regret giving you up.
我每天都在後悔把你送人

260
00:18:36,68 --> 00:18:38,24
Okay,bye.
好，再見

261
00:18:40,01 --> 00:18:41,21
I'm not done.
我還沒說完

262
00:18:41,42 --> 00:18:44,87
The reason I never looked you up was because...
我之所以沒找過你是因為…

263
00:18:45,25 --> 00:18:47,19
...I was afraid you'd react...
我很怕你的反應

264
00:18:47,42 --> 00:18:50,75
...just like the way you're reacting now.
會跟現在一樣

265
00:18:51,02 --> 00:18:54,46
Can't we just start from here? Please?
我們不能從現在開始嗎？

266
00:18:56,10 --> 00:18:57,96
No.
不行

267
00:19:01,14 --> 00:19:02,19
好吧

268
00:19:02,97 --> 00:19:04,84
Sorry.
抱歉

269
00:19:06,71 --> 00:19:08,17
One last thing.
最後一件事

270
00:19:09,38 --> 00:19:11,81
You came looking for family.
你來找你的家人

271
00:19:13,31 --> 00:19:14,97
I'm family.
我就是了

272
00:19:16,45 --> 00:19:18,21
I'm it.
沒別人了

273
00:19:20,99 --> 00:19:22,68
Now I'm done.
我說完了

274
00:19:25,83 --> 00:19:29,02
It's not like we're losing anything.
我們又沒什麼損失

275
00:19:30,06 --> 00:19:31,89
I guess you're right.
你說得對

276
00:19:32,40 --> 00:19:36,80
It's not like we know each other or have anything in common.
我們又不熟 也沒什麼共同點

277
00:19:37,27 --> 00:19:39,10
I don't know. It's not like...
我不曉得，我們不見得…

278
00:19:39,31 --> 00:19:41,97
...we don't have anything in common.
沒有共同點

279
00:19:43,74 --> 00:19:46,08
I mean,I like pizza.
像我喜歡披薩

280
00:19:47,35 --> 00:19:48,51
I like pizza!
我也喜歡披薩

281
00:19:50,48 --> 00:19:52,95
Wait,I like the Beatles.
是嗎？等等，我喜歡披頭四

282
00:19:53,22 --> 00:19:54,69
Oh,my God! So do l.
天哪，我也是

283
00:19:56,96 --> 00:19:59,05
Puppies. Cute or ugly?
等等，小狗狗可不可愛？

284
00:19:59,23 --> 00:20:01,22
So cute!
可愛死了

285
00:20:02,66 --> 00:20:04,13
You see?
看吧

286
00:20:04,83 --> 00:20:06,80
But I'm still mad at you.
但我還是很氣你

287
00:20:06,97 --> 00:20:08,53
I know.
我知道

288
00:20:09,57 --> 00:20:11,47
I'm mad at me too.
我也很氣自己

289
00:20:13,14 --> 00:20:17,51
Do you want to get something to eat? I'm kind of hungry.
你想吃東西嗎？我有點餓

290
00:20:17,84 --> 00:20:19,68
Hey! Me too!
我也是 

291
00:20:19,85 --> 00:20:21,87
Uncanny.
太不可思議了

292
00:20:23,65 --> 00:20:26,12
It looks like rain and I don't have my umbrella.
好像快下雨了，我沒帶傘

293
00:20:26,29 --> 00:20:27,78
Me neither. I really hate that.
我也是，真討厭

294
00:20:27,96 --> 00:20:31,65
Stop it. Now you're just doing it to freak me out.
夠了，你現在只是想嚇我

295
00:20:37,66 --> 00:20:39,33
I missed you.
我好想你

296
00:20:39,57 --> 00:20:41,43
I missed you too.
我也很想你

297
00:20:44,27 --> 00:20:47,26
I was so nervous about that letter.
我對那封信好緊張

298
00:20:50,14 --> 00:20:53,51
But the way you owned up to everything...
但是你這麼坦然認錯

299
00:20:53,78 --> 00:20:57,24
...it just showed me how much you've grown.
證明你真的成長不少

300
00:20:59,62 --> 00:21:01,45
I suppose.
大概吧

301
00:21:02,19 --> 00:21:06,18
You have,Ross. You should give yourself credit.
你有，羅斯，你不該妄自菲薄

302
00:21:06,49 --> 00:21:10,02
My mom never thought this would work out.
我媽一直覺得我們無法復合

303
00:21:11,03 --> 00:21:14,80
She said,"Once a cheater, always a cheater."
她說：出軌是不可原諒的

304
00:21:18,81 --> 00:21:21,83
I just wish we hadn't lost those four months.
真希望沒有這4個月的空白

305
00:21:22,48 --> 00:21:27,28
But if time was what you needed to gain a little perspective....
但要是時間能讓你看清楚一點

306
00:21:28,98 --> 00:21:31,71
We were on a break!
我們當時分手了！

307
00:21:32,92 --> 00:21:34,91
-Coffeehouse? -You bet.
喝咖啡？ 好

308
00:21:35,42 --> 00:21:39,48
It took two people to break up this relationship.
這段感情會破裂是兩個人的錯

309
00:21:39,73 --> 00:21:44,79
You and that girl, which yesterday you took full responsibility for.
對，你和影印店那個女的 你昨天表明願意負責

310
00:21:45,07 --> 00:21:47,80
I didn't know what I took responsibility for.
我不知道我負的是什麼責

311
00:21:48,00 --> 00:21:49,83
I didn't finish the letter.
我沒把信看完 什麼？

312
00:21:50,64 --> 00:21:51,90
I fell asleep.
我睡著了

313
00:21:52,17 --> 00:21:54,16
You fell asleep?
你睡著了？

314
00:21:55,14 --> 00:21:57,98
It was 5:30 in the morning.
當時是早上5點半

315
00:21:58,21 --> 00:22:03,08
And you had rambled on for 18 pages.
你一廢話就廢話了十八頁

316
00:22:04,48 --> 00:22:06,65
Front and back!
從頭到尾

317
00:22:08,46 --> 00:22:13,32
By the way,Y-O-U-apostrophe-R-E means "you are."
還有 「you're」是指「you are」

318
00:22:13,59 --> 00:22:15,22
Y-O-U-R means "your."
「Y-O-U-R」是代表your

319
00:22:16,36 --> 00:22:21,23
I can't believe I thought of getting back with you! We are so over.
我居然會想跟你復合 我們根本就完了

320
00:22:23,04 --> 00:22:24,40
Fine by me!
無所謂

321
00:22:25,71 --> 00:22:29,84
Those spelling tips will be handy Saturday nights at home...
你星期六晚上 跟摩妮卡玩拼字遊戲時

322
00:22:30,08 --> 00:22:31,94
...playing Scrabble with Monica.
一定不會寫錯字

323
00:22:32,58 --> 00:22:33,84
Sorry!
對不起

324
00:22:35,02 --> 00:22:38,54
All that sleep you'll miss wishing you were with me!
我只可憐你會想我想到失眠

325
00:22:38,75 --> 00:22:41,19
Don't worry about me falling asleep.
別怕我會睡不著

326
00:22:41,52 --> 00:22:43,72
I still have your letter!
我還有你的信

327
00:22:45,59 --> 00:22:48,43
Just so you know, it's not that common.
順便告訴你 這種事並不常見

328
00:22:48,63 --> 00:22:50,89
It doesn't happen to every guy.
並非男人都會這樣

329
00:22:51,10 --> 00:22:53,03
And it is a big deal!
這是很嚴重的

330
00:22:53,90 --> 00:22:55,70
I knew it!
我就知道

331
00:23:00,34 --> 00:23:01,50
Gin.
我贏了

332
00:23:02,98 --> 00:23:04,97
We were playing gin?
我們在玩金羅美牌？

333
00:23:07,05 --> 00:23:10,21
If we were a couple, we could play naked.
如果我們是一對，就可以光著身體玩了

334
00:23:11,12 --> 00:23:14,71
-Would you stop? -Okay. All right.
別再說了 好吧

336
00:23:14,99 --> 00:23:15,82
All right.
好啦

337
00:23:16,06 --> 00:23:17,72
I think you're great.
我覺得你很棒

338
00:23:18,09 --> 00:23:20,82
I think you're sweet and smart...
我覺得你人很好，很聰明

339
00:23:21,40 --> 00:23:23,42
...and I love you.
我愛你

340
00:23:24,43 --> 00:23:27,76
But you'll always be the guy who peed on me.
但你永遠是在我身上撒尿的人

341
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


342
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


